---

# Character Philosophy

Characters are canonical definitions.

They should answer the question

> "Who is this person?"

They should never answer

> "Where are they right now?"

Current location,

emotion,

inventory,

relationships,

current memories,

current goals,

current actions,

and health

belong exclusively to the World State.

This separation allows the same Character definition to persist while the simulated world evolves independently.
