The Timeline stores canonical events.

Events are ordered chronologically.

Structure

```json
{
    "id":"",

    "title":"",

    "description":"",

    "participants":[],

    "location":"",

    "sequence":0,

    "metadata":{}
}
```

---

## id

Format

```
evt_<name>
```

Example

```
evt_sorting

evt_troll_attack

evt_final_battle
```

---

## title

Human-readable event name.

Example

```
Sorting Ceremony
```

---

## description

Brief summary.

Example

```
First-year students are sorted into their Hogwarts houses.
```

---

## participants

Example

```json
[
    "char_harry",
    "char_hermione",
    "char_ron"
]
```

---

## location

Location ID.

Example

```
loc_great_hall
```

---

## sequence

Canonical chronological order.

Example

```
