---

## Timeline Validation

✓ Every participant exists

✓ Location exists

✓ Sequence unique

✓ Timeline ordered

✓ No duplicate events

✓ Valid IDs

---

# Timeline Philosophy

The Timeline records what originally happened in the story.

It should never contain alternate events.

Alternate histories belong in the World State and snapshots.

The Timeline is the historical backbone of the universe.

It answers

> "What happened in canon?"

not

> "What happened during this playthrough?"
